      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCY'S MATE (4) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (20.45) at this track in a Maiden. Better than latest and can atone here. RED RUST (7) is a first starter by Feral Franky out of She's Got Moves with no trial form to work with. Market should provide a lead to his ability. PAY THE PIPER (3) is still a maiden after 16 runs but rarely out of the placings, the latest filling a minor again when third at this track. Has placed at his last three starts now. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Expecting another good run. TAILORED (2) can feature with the right run.",
